{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38935","headline":"题江寺禅和 · 杜荀鹤","name":"题江寺禅和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江寺禅僧似悟禅，坏衣芒履住茅轩。\n懒求施主修真像，翻说经文是妄言。\n出浦钓船惊宿鴈，伐岩樵斧迸寒猿。\n行人莫问师宗旨，眼不浮华耳不喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}